FRE LAUNCH v0.5.10 unsigned Windows preview — final unified native Rust UI.
2026-11-03 after Rust polish preflight #41638950710 SUCCESS (31/31 tests, Vue TypeScript, production Vite, verified source patches).
Includes:
- Rust native and legacy Horizon records in same Java-style quick instance switcher/sidebar.
- Selection checkbox and shared Java selection state for native Rust cards, safe mixed Rust+Java bulk deletion with the native rust_delete_profile command, Java IDs never sent to native engine.
- Standard Java-style tabbed Rust settings, Play, game files, delete confirmation, transitions and original onboarding checks.
- Remove redundant standalone CurseForge link: normal Browse Content source selector stays.
- No claim of downloading proprietary game assets. Current engine can import verified prepared resources from an authenticated owner's existing Minecraft installation; clean one-click Mojang game asset installation is not yet implemented.
- Do not touch existing world files, Java profiles, updater public key or signed v0.5.9 stable release.
Require actual Windows Tauri compilation, pinned MIT engine signature/license, SHA256 of all binaries, Defender scan, NSIS silent-install & launcher smoke before uploading artifact.
No signing secret; preview is not an automatic updater release.
